<p>Nairobi gets most of the attention, but some of the best first dates happen elsewhere. If you are looking for first date ideas outside Nairobi, Kenya has plenty of choice: warm coastal evenings in Mombasa, breezy lakeside walks in Kisumu, green parks in Nakuru, cool mornings in Nyeri and open skies near Naivasha. Smaller towns often have a slower pace, which makes it easier to relax and talk.</p>
