<p>Think about comfort too. Wear shoes that suit walking, carry water and sun protection at the coast, and bring a light jacket in the highlands. Keep a simple plan B in your head, such as a cafe nearby, in case the rain comes or the place is too crowded. Being prepared helps you relax and focus on your date.</p>

<h2>Keep it safe and comfortable</h2>
